# Large pandeia reference data (~4.3 GB per release; see README "Backend
# configuration"). Globbed, not per-release: these were pinned to the 2026.2
# names, so adding the 2026.7 triple made 4.3 GB show up as untracked and one
# `git add -A` away from the history.
data/pandeia_data-*/
data/pandeia_psfs-*/
# PandExo-side scratch from the 2026-07-12 parity run (cdbs symlink shim +
# noise cache + a pickled single run) -- machine-local, never tracked
pandeia_2026_refdata/

# Internal working documents. The published reference set lives in README.md
# (physics/conventions, PICASO engine, decision records, open gaps, data
# provenance, deployment, parity testing) since the 2026-08 consolidation;
# dev logs and investigations live in the gitignored root notes.md.
CLAUDE.md
/notes.md

# Machine-local live-validation transcript (the 2026-07-21 record is merged
# into the root notes.md; regenerate with
# JWST_TOOL_RUN_PICASO_LIVE=1 python -m pytest tests/live -q)
tests/live/RESULTS_v18_1.md

# Machine-local absolute-path symlink into a sibling PICASO checkout. Consumers
# obtain the PHOENIX grid via `jwst-tool fetch`; `jwst-tool data` reports status.
data/cdbs/grid/phoenix

